{
  "title": "Yellow Cheesy Venezuelan Cannellini Bean Stew",
  "description": "A festive and flavorful Venezuelan dish featuring cannellini beans and a blend of cheeses, cooked to perfection in a kazan cauldron. This low-fat friendly stew is perfect for a weeknight dinner.",
